{"about_the_game":"Created by Savage Studios, S.C.A.R (A.k.a Simulating Carnage And Rockets) is a First-Person Shooter,  that as-the-name-implies, simulates carnage.<br />\r\nFace endless hordes of monsters and mutated beasts, with only one goal in mind. Your demise.<br />\r\nKill your way through lots of stages, enter portals, and use lots of weapons with many uses against enemies.<br />\r\nYou also have a grappling hook that can grab anything and take you close or far from it.<br />\r\nWith a powerful and aggressive music to match the environment you are in, immerse through enemies and bosses, reaching the end of the stage, and going straight to the next one.<br />\r\nS.C.A.R offers you a retro experience of monster killing and bloody action.","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/1050720?t=1595511849","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/1050720?t=1595511849","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1050720/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1595511849","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1050720/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1595511849","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"demos":[{"appid":1290020,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<h1>Roadmap</h1><p><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1050720/extras/b8fc3448365a13450560c168e2ba5dcd.avif?t=1595511849\" width=629 height=468 /></span></p><br><h1>Different Filters</h1><p><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1050720/extras/59d7d2d69ba1834a1ad681ae5f7a61c8.poster.avif?t=159551184